OL,3,GNEWSAThe undercover HGV catching
OL,4,Adrivers on their phones
OL,5,
OL,6,FA growing number of drivers are risking
OL,7,Flives by using mobile phones behind the
OL,8,Fwheel despite tougher penalties, police
OL,9,Fhave told the BBC.
OL,11,FFrustrated by the lack of compliance,
OL,12,Fthe Thames Valley force is now
OL,13,Fdeploying sophisticated undercover
OL,14,Ftactics to catch people in the act.
OL,16,FAs part of Operation Tramline, officers
OL,17,Fin an undercover HGV scan motorway
OL,18,Ftraffic from above, pointing out
OL,19,Foffenders for colleagues to chase down
OL,20,Fand take enforcement action.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
