OL,3,GNEWSAThe undercover HGV catching
OL,4,Adrivers on their phones
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe four-day operation along parts of
OL,7,Fthe M40 and M25 saw 54 people penalised
OL,8,Ffor using their mobile phone, more than
OL,9,Fhalf of the 99 total offences, and many
OL,10,Fwho already had points on their
OL,11,Flicence.
